This helper bundles selected modules from @proxyshard/shardx 2.1.6.
Upstream: https://github.com/ProxyShard/ShardBrowser
Fixed source revision: 99e780e2e685e5b3b5357c5baee8796e10b3ce1e
The private applyNoiseSeeds helper is extracted unchanged from the published,
SHA256-verified dist/browser.js. The SDK index and browser launcher are not
bundled. Initial profile creation calls upstream profile, hardware, screen and
version functions. vm2api fixes page language and supplies the slot timezone.

